WEBVTT

01:40.550 --> 01:42.990
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.140 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 23]

01:47.430 --> 01:48.060
Hey.

01:49.690 --> 01:51.000
Why are you all speaking in riddles?

01:51.000 --> 01:52.080
What's going on?

01:52.310 --> 01:53.370
It's very possible

01:53.390 --> 01:54.650
that Li Lun is not dead.

01:55.300 --> 01:55.930
What?

01:59.229 --> 02:00.290
When Li Lun died,

02:00.310 --> 02:02.060
did you see his inner core?

02:02.080 --> 02:02.690
No.

02:02.870 --> 02:03.990
We thought at the time that his inner core

02:03.990 --> 02:06.430
had been burned to ashes by the Ever-Burning Wood.

02:06.430 --> 02:07.230
There!

02:07.260 --> 02:09.919
Li Lun has the ability to possess living beings.

02:09.949 --> 02:11.450
He must have placed his inner core

02:11.450 --> 02:12.880
inside someone at the scene

02:12.880 --> 02:15.260
before he died.

02:15.320 --> 02:16.780
Thus, as his soul was scattering

02:16.780 --> 02:18.550
when he was burned by the Ever-Burning Wood,

02:18.550 --> 02:20.680
he had already possessed that person.

02:23.270 --> 02:25.070
A life without death.

02:29.470 --> 02:31.940
You will kill him one day.

02:33.500 --> 02:35.600
Kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

02:40.420 --> 02:41.579
It's Zhuo.

02:43.850 --> 02:45.310
Li Lun must have possessed Zhuo

02:45.310 --> 02:46.550
at that moment.

03:40.540 --> 03:42.340
So now, Mr. Zhuo...

03:43.460 --> 03:44.670
is Li Lun.

03:45.410 --> 03:46.250
Let's go.

03:46.620 --> 03:47.230
Otherwise,

03:47.230 --> 03:48.690
Li Lun will kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

03:48.690 --> 03:49.240
Let's go.

04:35.550 --> 04:37.050
I brought wine.

04:38.080 --> 04:39.250
But it seems like

04:41.840 --> 04:43.440
you won't be able to drink it.

04:46.190 --> 04:47.430
I once swore

04:47.630 --> 04:48.840
that I would

04:51.810 --> 04:54.750
personally settle the debt between us.

04:55.520 --> 04:57.320
The journey we walked together,

05:00.060 --> 05:01.650
with all its past events,

05:04.510 --> 05:05.950
made me feel

05:06.990 --> 05:07.910
that maybe

05:08.080 --> 05:09.730
oaths can be broken

05:11.310 --> 05:13.280
and fate can be changed.

05:16.630 --> 05:17.430
But...

05:20.660 --> 05:21.870
this day...

05:23.650 --> 05:25.080
has ultimately come.

05:28.820 --> 05:30.170
Like a book

05:31.600 --> 05:33.980
with its ending already written,

05:39.030 --> 05:41.170
no matter how many times I read it,

05:47.370 --> 05:48.370
the ending

05:53.430 --> 05:54.670
is always the same.

07:25.270 --> 07:26.990
Great Demon, are you alright?

07:30.780 --> 07:32.580
Li Lun has already made his move.

07:33.080 --> 07:34.150
Then let's go quickly.

07:34.150 --> 07:34.700
Wait!

07:36.050 --> 07:38.050
Let's repair the Baize Token first.

07:39.070 --> 07:40.780
Otherwise, even if we arrive in time,

07:40.780 --> 07:42.630
we won't be able to wake Zhao Yuanzhou.

07:42.630 --> 07:43.270
Yes.

07:43.700 --> 07:44.610
The Yao Water.

08:21.060 --> 08:26.240
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

08:26.280 --> 08:29.390
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

08:29.470 --> 08:32.480
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

08:32.549 --> 08:34.020
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

08:34.039 --> 08:38.950
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

08:38.980 --> 08:42.120
♫My definitions for right and wrong differ♫

08:42.440 --> 08:45.360
♫Bury your pride in the raging river♫

08:45.400 --> 08:48.640
♫Lamenting that all beings are powerless♫

10:43.710 --> 10:44.550
Jiu!

10:44.830 --> 10:45.550
Jiu!

11:02.630 --> 11:03.880
Let's fight together.

11:03.880 --> 11:05.350
One person for each,

11:05.370 --> 11:06.970
and we'll find its weakness.

11:18.090 --> 11:19.690
The one with Ying Lei is fake.

11:31.560 --> 11:33.160
The one with the kitchen knife is the real Ying Lei.

11:33.160 --> 11:33.930
What?

11:33.960 --> 11:34.980
Don't mess around!

11:34.980 --> 11:36.170
He took my kitchen knife!

11:36.170 --> 11:36.950
Don't do anything reckless!

11:36.950 --> 11:37.520
Huh?

11:37.630 --> 11:38.700
Don't believe him!

11:39.670 --> 11:41.010
Ao Yin is full of tricks

11:41.040 --> 11:42.170
and can continuously change its shape,

11:42.170 --> 11:43.000
making it hard to distinguish.

11:43.000 --> 11:43.590
Don't worry about me.

11:43.590 --> 11:44.250
I'll handle it myself!

11:44.250 --> 11:45.780
We'll handle it ourselves!

12:55.970 --> 12:56.660
Jiu?

13:04.440 --> 13:05.510
Jiu, be careful.

13:33.430 --> 13:34.810
Open the door!

13:36.120 --> 13:37.090
Open the door...

13:38.730 --> 13:40.040
Brother Zhuo!

13:40.370 --> 13:41.750
Brother Zhuo, save me!

13:41.830 --> 13:42.820
Brother Zhuo!

13:43.080 --> 13:44.200
Brother Zhuo!

13:49.470 --> 13:50.270
You...

13:52.430 --> 13:53.910
You're not Bai Jiu.

13:54.800 --> 13:56.260
You are Li Lun.

13:57.740 --> 13:59.420
I'm so disappointed.

14:00.640 --> 14:02.010
It's only now

14:03.190 --> 14:04.730
that you've figured it out.

14:05.560 --> 14:06.880
Darn it.

14:08.920 --> 14:10.350
We were tricked by you.

14:10.370 --> 14:11.770
When did you do it?

14:11.800 --> 14:14.360
I had already placed my inner core

14:15.590 --> 14:17.650
inside Bai Jiu's body in the illusion

14:18.070 --> 14:20.060
of the Demon Hunting Bureau,

14:20.480 --> 14:22.820
preparing to possess him at any time.

14:31.020 --> 14:33.830
So, I've underestimated you.

14:35.080 --> 14:36.350
But...

14:37.540 --> 14:40.590
this is indeed a great gift.

14:43.540 --> 14:45.020
I just possessed him,

14:45.320 --> 14:46.700
so my power is weak,

14:47.030 --> 14:49.760
and I haven't fully controlled this body.

14:50.830 --> 14:51.870
Therefore,

14:52.840 --> 14:54.030
during this time,

14:54.470 --> 14:57.330
I can only come out and act

14:58.410 --> 15:00.220
when he's asleep at night.

15:05.750 --> 15:07.170
Even so,

15:08.590 --> 15:10.290
it was enough

15:10.410 --> 15:12.610
for you to take on Wen Xiao's appearance

15:12.660 --> 15:14.640
and kill the Prime Minister.

15:15.180 --> 15:16.620
I'd like to see,

15:17.100 --> 15:19.630
with her being wanted throughout the city,

15:20.340 --> 15:22.800
if she still has time to find the Divine Wood.

15:24.350 --> 15:25.140
Yes.

15:26.070 --> 15:27.240
So,

15:28.260 --> 15:30.620
just now, Ao Yin deliberately knocked out Jiu

15:30.620 --> 15:33.020
to let you out and control the situation?

15:33.050 --> 15:33.860
That's right.

15:34.950 --> 15:35.870
Otherwise,

15:36.670 --> 15:38.160
how could I stop you?

15:38.620 --> 15:40.280
You deceived Mr. Zhuo,

15:40.430 --> 15:42.090
using him to kill.

15:42.310 --> 15:44.280
What exactly do you plan to do to Great Demon?

15:44.280 --> 15:45.270
Mr. Zhuo,

15:45.480 --> 15:47.280
this is the Soul Trapping Needle

15:47.430 --> 15:48.500
that I've been developing for a long time

15:48.500 --> 15:49.470
and have finally created.

15:49.470 --> 15:50.470
It's a suspended animation decoction

15:50.470 --> 15:51.430
made from Death Ginseng

15:51.430 --> 15:53.380
and Kusnezoff Monkshood Root.

15:57.430 --> 15:58.410
Why did you

15:58.430 --> 16:00.290
suddenly start developing this?

16:03.740 --> 16:05.510
I just wanted to

16:05.800 --> 16:08.400
make up for the harm I caused everyone.

16:09.700 --> 16:11.510
You don't need to feel guilty.

16:12.140 --> 16:13.450
It was not your fault,

16:14.530 --> 16:15.700
but Li Lun's.

16:20.110 --> 16:22.440
What exactly is the Soul Trapping Needle?

16:22.580 --> 16:25.230
I used half of my soul's power

16:26.100 --> 16:27.700
to condense it into a needle.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.830
It can trap spirits

16:30.620 --> 16:32.010
and control souls.

16:33.590 --> 16:34.460
Don't worry.

16:35.880 --> 16:37.020
This time,

16:38.040 --> 16:40.580
Zhao Yuanzhou is entirely under my control.

16:42.360 --> 16:46.020
As long as we succeed in driving it into the center of his forehead,

16:46.020 --> 16:48.350
he will be mine to command.

16:49.100 --> 16:51.500
He will no longer remember who he is,

16:53.670 --> 16:54.530
and naturally,

16:55.710 --> 16:57.140
he will forget all of you.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.320
From now on,

17:00.070 --> 17:02.400
he will only obediently follow my orders.

17:03.550 --> 17:05.550
And the malicious energy he carries

17:06.069 --> 17:08.010
will no longer be his curse,

17:08.760 --> 17:12.089
but rather the sharp edge with which he dominates the world.

17:46.750 --> 17:48.460
Are you reluctant to do it?

17:50.910 --> 17:51.850
That's right.

17:52.810 --> 17:53.670
If you strike a few more times,

17:53.670 --> 17:55.000
I may not die,

17:55.750 --> 17:56.860
but Bai Jiu...

17:57.080 --> 17:58.630
definitely will.

18:39.400 --> 18:41.820
I raised this piece of Divine Wood myself.

18:42.010 --> 18:44.470
During the 300 years trapped in the sundial,

18:44.820 --> 18:47.300
I played this melody every day.

18:48.250 --> 18:50.050
It naturally resonates with me.

18:54.810 --> 18:56.020
Goddess,

18:56.310 --> 18:57.460
go and find Zhao Yuanzhou.

18:57.460 --> 18:58.880
Leave this to us!

20:13.400 --> 20:14.330
Zhao Yuanzhou!

20:15.080 --> 20:17.650
I don't want to kill you with the Cloud Light Sword.

20:17.650 --> 20:18.580
So,

20:19.030 --> 20:20.500
I must do this.

20:34.340 --> 20:35.530
This time,

20:37.190 --> 20:38.920
I bled myself for you.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.510
Zhuo, stop!

22:07.510 --> 22:09.240
That silver needle is fake!

22:14.830 --> 22:15.630
Zhuo!

22:20.340 --> 22:21.110
Zhuo.

22:21.150 --> 22:22.610
Why are you here?

22:23.400 --> 22:25.100
Bai Jiu has been controlled by Li Lun.

22:25.100 --> 22:26.460
Go out and help them first.

22:26.460 --> 22:27.790
Leave Great Demon to me.

22:28.650 --> 22:29.680
No.

22:30.670 --> 22:32.070
It's too dangerous here.

22:42.470 --> 22:43.460
Don't worry.

22:46.860 --> 22:47.960
Be careful.

23:30.840 --> 23:32.840
Where is Jing's Shadow Hunting Bow?

24:03.460 --> 24:04.810
Where is Zhao Yuanzhou?

24:05.320 --> 24:07.580
A calamity can last for a thousand years.

24:07.770 --> 24:09.030
Don't worry.

24:09.170 --> 24:10.310
He's fine.

25:25.900 --> 25:28.460
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

25:28.480 --> 25:31.050
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

25:31.410 --> 25:36.450
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

25:37.790 --> 25:39.590
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

25:39.810 --> 25:42.350
♫Someone is longing for♫

25:42.610 --> 25:43.700
♫Softly calling for♫

25:43.800 --> 25:47.840
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

25:48.190 --> 25:50.800
♫The world echoes with a single sigh♫

25:50.860 --> 25:53.360
♫Love and hate each fills half the heart♫

25:53.630 --> 25:58.710
♫The years are filled with grudges and grace♫

25:59.830 --> 26:01.930
♫The cry of summer cicadas♫

26:01.980 --> 26:04.590
♫The slumber of winter snow♫

26:04.810 --> 26:10.120
♫No idle wishes and no hopeless longing for eternity♫

26:10.310 --> 26:15.780
♫Who saw the young man in beautiful clothes♫

26:15.830 --> 26:21.130
♫One step at a time, chasing every yesterday♫

26:21.670 --> 26:24.330
♫The sun beams down on the world♫

26:24.480 --> 26:27.070
♫Put everything behind♫

26:27.210 --> 26:32.510
♫You appear in my dream♫

26:40.400 --> 26:45.240
♫The flower in my palm♫

26:45.580 --> 26:50.790
♫Is everchanging♫

26:51.470 --> 26:56.330
♫Sand slips through fingertips♫

26:56.960 --> 27:01.710
♫Struggling again and again♫

27:02.670 --> 27:07.510
♫The sea of suffering has no end♫

27:08.400 --> 27:12.110
♫The spring breeze asks him♫

27:12.210 --> 27:18.820
♫What troubles turned his hair white♫

27:16.930 --> 27:18.640
If only...

27:21.260 --> 27:22.780
you were real.

27:30.380 --> 27:31.310
Unfortunately,

27:37.210 --> 27:39.380
this is just my imagination.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.330
In your imagination,

27:55.410 --> 27:57.270
would I hit you this way?

27:58.670 --> 27:59.350
Yes,

27:59.370 --> 28:01.110
but it wouldn't hurt this much.

28:04.970 --> 28:07.370
♫One light, one fire, one crescent moon♫

28:07.480 --> 28:10.020
♫The vow of life and death♫

28:10.390 --> 28:15.570
♫Yet tears leave without a goodbye♫

28:15.880 --> 28:18.540
♫No need to borrow strong wine; it's in my heart♫

28:18.840 --> 28:21.310
♫The dark hair doesn't turn white like snow♫

28:21.410 --> 28:26.630
♫Some other time, let's watch the setting sun again♫

28:24.240 --> 28:25.040
So...

28:27.190 --> 28:29.770
♫The cruel debts of fate♫

28:29.560 --> 28:31.130
I'm not dreaming?

28:29.830 --> 28:32.440
♫Are exchanged for the phrase "I'm willing"♫

28:32.720 --> 28:33.960
♫Wind blows in the distance♫

28:33.780 --> 28:34.900
What do you think?

28:34.100 --> 28:37.970
♫The distant boat approaches the shore♫

28:47.060 --> 28:48.250
The Baize Token

28:49.530 --> 28:50.820
is fixed?

28:52.480 --> 28:53.110
Yes.

28:57.310 --> 28:58.880
Why do you seem

29:00.680 --> 29:02.530
different from before?

29:08.510 --> 29:10.110
We've been apart for so long.

29:12.230 --> 29:14.690
Of course, things have been a bit different.

29:18.210 --> 29:19.210
Was it long?

29:20.720 --> 29:24.620
♫The little city traps♫

29:24.650 --> 29:26.840
♫The little us♫

29:26.930 --> 29:30.100
♫Going around and around♫

29:30.350 --> 29:31.840
♫Dusk and dawn♫

29:33.040 --> 29:35.130
♫The heavy door♫

29:35.500 --> 29:39.040
♫Who is waiting foolishly♫

29:39.150 --> 29:44.700
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

29:45.490 --> 29:47.560
♫The pillow of the past♫

29:47.860 --> 29:51.410
♫Still has the warmth of the dream♫

29:51.550 --> 29:53.750
♫The dust from yesterday♫

29:54.010 --> 29:56.600
♫Covering my eyes♫

29:57.820 --> 29:59.780
♫The person in the dream♫

30:00.120 --> 30:03.670
♫Is silent, waiting with each step♫

30:03.960 --> 30:07.280
♫Refuses to leave, and refuses♫

30:07.300 --> 30:08.840
♫To turn around♫

30:10.030 --> 30:13.670
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

30:13.950 --> 30:16.060
♫Many stories♫

30:16.370 --> 30:20.720
♫There's a name in her heart♫

30:22.450 --> 30:23.880
♫The human world♫

30:23.910 --> 30:26.070
♫The ink is mottled♫

30:26.230 --> 30:28.380
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

30:28.470 --> 30:29.860
♫Can't clearly write it♫

30:30.100 --> 30:31.320
♫Can't completely express it♫

30:31.650 --> 30:33.660
♫This karma♫

31:02.310 --> 31:05.920
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

31:06.250 --> 31:08.370
♫Too much on her mind♫

31:08.560 --> 31:13.030
♫There's a blank spot♫

31:14.720 --> 31:16.050
♫The human world♫

31:16.130 --> 31:18.320
♫The clouds in the sky♫

31:18.390 --> 31:20.690
♫The end of the bitter sea♫

31:20.790 --> 31:22.170
♫A dream♫

31:22.280 --> 31:23.520
♫A pair of hands♫

31:23.800 --> 31:25.900
♫A cup of wine♫

31:28.430 --> 31:30.720
[300 years]

31:34.490 --> 31:35.970
One day apart

31:37.400 --> 31:39.100
felt like three years, right?

31:43.950 --> 31:45.610
If you say so.

31:50.930 --> 31:52.240
One day apart

31:54.370 --> 31:55.950
felt like three years.

32:27.750 --> 32:28.650
Jiu!

32:28.910 --> 32:29.860
Jiu!

32:31.170 --> 32:31.960
Jiu!

32:33.260 --> 32:34.340
Jiu!

32:34.910 --> 32:36.100
Brother Zhuo.

32:36.130 --> 32:37.070
Brother Zhuo, is that you?

32:37.070 --> 32:38.260
Brother Zhuo?

32:38.860 --> 32:40.240
So annoying.

32:43.010 --> 32:43.930
Look closely.

32:45.390 --> 32:47.210
I'm not your Jiu.

32:47.880 --> 32:49.490
I'm Li Lun.

32:50.680 --> 32:53.740
I will make sure you die knowing exactly who killed you.

32:53.910 --> 32:56.230
See with your last look

32:56.290 --> 32:58.100
who killed you.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.660
I hated this bow so much back then.

34:08.560 --> 34:09.489
I never imagined

34:09.870 --> 34:10.790
that one day

34:10.880 --> 34:12.330
I would risk my life

34:12.469 --> 34:14.199
fighting a demon to reclaim it.

34:29.250 --> 34:30.510
Thank you, Heng.

34:29.760 --> 34:32.010
♫An arrow in the hand♫

34:32.679 --> 34:34.850
♫A string in the heart♫

34:35.540 --> 34:40.830
♫A backside standing, turning into forever♫

34:41.150 --> 34:43.400
♫The moon shines on the south♫

34:44.020 --> 34:46.320
♫But I look north♫

34:46.810 --> 34:51.830
♫I only hope the snow comes a bit later♫

35:07.080 --> 35:08.260
Mr. Zhuo!

35:49.000 --> 35:51.250
Don't you hurt Brother Zhuo!

36:15.070 --> 36:16.010
Brother Zhuo!

36:57.170 --> 36:59.020
Don't waste your effort.

36:59.720 --> 37:02.940
My inner core has been inside Bai Jiu's body for many days.

37:02.970 --> 37:05.070
My soul has already solidified,

37:05.110 --> 37:07.310
making it much stronger than Bai Jiu's.

37:07.750 --> 37:10.250
His soul is nothing but a weak ant

37:10.430 --> 37:12.500
compared to mine,

37:12.530 --> 37:14.390
which can be easily crushed by me.

37:16.370 --> 37:19.690
After staying for the last few hours,

37:20.440 --> 37:22.330
his soul

37:22.910 --> 37:25.570
will never come out again.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.810
I'm too timid.

38:29.210 --> 38:30.040
But

38:30.070 --> 38:32.800
whenever I hear the bells on your braids ringing,

38:34.060 --> 38:35.370
I know

38:35.510 --> 38:37.450
you're by my side.

38:38.750 --> 38:40.360
And I'll feel safe.

38:48.030 --> 38:49.310
Are you scared?

38:49.940 --> 38:51.410
With you

38:51.790 --> 38:53.910
and your powerful Cloud Light Sword here,

38:53.910 --> 38:55.390
I'm not that scared.

39:12.880 --> 39:14.230
I'm sure it will be fine.

40:00.820 --> 40:02.270
Mr. Zhuo!

40:05.360 --> 40:07.300
Your body can't take any more!

40:07.340 --> 40:09.800
Don't consume any more of your Bingyi blood!

40:29.620 --> 40:32.160
Give Jiu back to me!

42:09.940 --> 42:10.740
Zhuo!

42:14.170 --> 42:14.970
Li Lun!

42:25.580 --> 42:26.650
Mr. Zhuo.

42:31.450 --> 42:32.980
You're really hard to kill.

42:34.040 --> 42:36.300
You ultimately managed to escape death.

42:36.560 --> 42:38.740
How could I possibly die before you?

42:38.760 --> 42:40.370
Mr. Zhuo, wake up.

42:40.980 --> 42:43.040
I promise I won't argue with you anymore,

42:43.040 --> 42:43.760
okay?

42:44.130 --> 42:44.940
Mr. Zhuo.

42:45.230 --> 42:46.490
Zhao Yuanzhou,

42:47.020 --> 42:48.950
I'm actually very grateful to you.

42:51.070 --> 42:53.790
If it weren't for you bringing this kid to me,

42:54.190 --> 42:56.720
how could I have obtained such a perfect body,

42:56.810 --> 42:59.720
so well-matched to my pagoda ghost form?

43:01.760 --> 43:04.620
You've finally done something that makes me happy.

43:05.870 --> 43:08.070
You cooperated with Wen Zongyu

43:08.490 --> 43:10.670
just for this body, didn't you?

43:11.200 --> 43:12.580
You know very well

43:13.180 --> 43:16.040
that once you break free from Baize Goddess's seal,

43:16.270 --> 43:19.020
your true form will quickly wither and die.

43:20.430 --> 43:22.150
You do know me well.

43:23.850 --> 43:25.250
But if anyone's to blame,

43:26.860 --> 43:28.860
it's Wen Zongyu for being ruthless.

43:29.850 --> 43:32.370
He even sacrificed his disciple.

43:32.960 --> 43:34.790
I've always told you

43:34.870 --> 43:36.330
that humans, though weak,

43:36.370 --> 43:38.190
are far more vicious

43:38.490 --> 43:39.890
than powerful demons.

43:41.270 --> 43:42.630
You never believed me.

43:44.240 --> 43:46.840
Wen Zongyu could even sacrifice his disciple.

43:46.980 --> 43:48.780
You're not his family or friend.

43:48.790 --> 43:50.530
How could you not see this?

43:52.020 --> 43:53.640
Of course, I can see this.

43:55.480 --> 43:56.830
We are just

43:58.270 --> 44:00.530
using each other to get what we each want.

44:01.910 --> 44:02.810
Li Lun,

44:04.660 --> 44:06.660
do you know his true purpose?

44:09.890 --> 44:11.530
The people of the world,

44:12.620 --> 44:14.270
bustling with activity,

44:15.080 --> 44:16.810
are driven by greed and desire.

44:18.290 --> 44:20.300
Wen Zongyu covets power

44:20.640 --> 44:22.700
and wants to destroy the Baize Token,

44:22.850 --> 44:24.550
allowing the demons of the Wilderness

44:24.550 --> 44:26.470
to enter the mortal world and create chaos.

44:26.470 --> 44:27.950
By doing so, he hopes to

44:27.970 --> 44:31.500
recreate the glory of Chongwu Camp's dominance over the world.

44:32.390 --> 44:33.550
However,

44:33.790 --> 44:35.610
Wen Zongyu is too naive.

44:36.630 --> 44:38.270
The naive one is you,

44:39.100 --> 44:39.910
Li Lun.

44:40.510 --> 44:42.970
You've lived for tens of thousands of years,

44:43.750 --> 44:47.000
but you're not even as wise as a ten-year-old child in the mortal world.

44:47.000 --> 44:49.220
Wen Zongyu has been hunting monsters

44:49.460 --> 44:51.260
and secretly researching them,

44:51.580 --> 44:54.780
hoping to create demonized humans stronger than demons,

44:56.000 --> 44:58.750
to eliminate all the demons in the world

44:59.690 --> 45:02.420
and turn the Wilderness into a barren wasteland.

45:02.440 --> 45:04.730
This is his true purpose.

45:06.550 --> 45:07.950
What?

45:08.120 --> 45:09.200
Eight years ago,

45:10.740 --> 45:13.620
in the mortal world, the little demons

45:14.950 --> 45:18.210
we saw being tortured in the dungeon

45:18.510 --> 45:21.750
were captured and imprisoned by Wen Zongyu's men.

45:22.330 --> 45:25.860
That was the very reason we turned against each other back then.

45:26.770 --> 45:28.010
But now,

45:29.480 --> 45:31.850
you are helping the very culprit.

45:33.790 --> 45:34.590
Li Lun,

45:35.370 --> 45:37.400
you once swore an oath with blood

45:38.520 --> 45:40.280
to protect the Wilderness.

45:44.270 --> 45:45.630
Have you forgotten?

45:47.360 --> 45:48.400
No, I haven't.

45:49.840 --> 45:51.200
You're lying to me.

45:53.080 --> 45:54.480
You're lying to me again.

45:55.160 --> 45:56.480
He's not lying.

45:58.200 --> 45:59.860
The one who's been lying to you

45:59.990 --> 46:01.710
is Wen Zongyu.

46:02.000 --> 46:03.330
If you don't believe it,

46:04.930 --> 46:07.660
go to the secret chamber in Chongwu Camp to check.

46:08.110 --> 46:10.060
There are the answers you want.
